# Decision exits unlabeled. Expected: FLOW-DECISION-GUARD (major).
diagram flowchart
id approval-unlabeled
title After review, a request takes one of two paths
narration A submitted request is reviewed, then approved or rejected.

start begin
process review "review request"
decision ok "approved?"
process schedule "schedule the work"
process notify "notify requester"
end done

begin -> review
review -> ok
ok -> schedule
ok -> notify
schedule -> done
notify -> done
